A '''mining town''' was active on the [[planet]] [[Christophsis]] during the [[Galactic Civil War]].<ref name="Star Wars 34" /> Around [[3 ABY]],<ref name="Date">The flashbacks of [[Star Wars (2020) 50|''Star Wars'' (2020) 50]] take place approximately twenty-two [[Standard year|years]] after [[Darth Sidious|Sheev Palpatine's]] [[Proclamation of the New Order|ascension]] to [[Galactic Emperor|Emperor]], which ''[[Star Wars: Timelines]]'' dates to [[19 BBY]], meaning they must occur around [[3 ABY]]. The flashbacks also take place after the events of [[Star Wars (2020) 43|''Star Wars'' (2020) 43]], which occur after the ''[[Star Wars: Dark Droids]]'' crossover event, an event {{SW|url=news/marvel-dark-droids-interview|text=Charles Soule Unleashes ''Dark Droids''}} places after ''[[Star Wars: War of the Bounty Hunters]]'', which is dated to 3 [['ABY-BBY' dating system|ABY]] by ''Timelines''. As [[Star Wars (2020) 34|''Star Wars'' (2020) 34]] takes place between ''War of the Bounty Hunters'' and ''Star Wars'' (2020) 43, its events must take place around 3 ABY.</ref> the [[human]] [[Jedi]] [[Luke Skywalker]] traveled to the town in search of [[kyber crystal]]s.<ref name="Star Wars 34" />

